    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_rival_01",
      "hash64": "6B6AAA96E5DDE546",
      "text": "Oooh, so this is Mossui Town?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_rival_02",
      "hash64": "6B6AA996E5DDE393",
      "text": "You all smell that, right? It kinda smells different\\nthan Paldea![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_botan_01",
      "hash64": "8E475FE6A0AFCAA8",
      "text": "Urrrgggh... My head’s still spinning too fast to\\nsee anything... Are we there yet?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_friend_01",
      "hash64": "CA7C0810D70061CA",
      "text": "Maybe you wouldn’t have gotten so carsick if you\\nhadn’t stared at your phone the whole bus ride.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_botan_02",
      "hash64": "8E4762E6A0AFCFC1",
      "text": "But I didn’t know if we’d get signal here... I had\\nto load up on internet goodness while I could...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_caretaker_01",
      "hash64": "A86DE2BE5C0FF1B2",
      "text": "Why, hello there![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_rival_03",
      "hash64": "6B6AA896E5DDE1E0",
      "text": "Hiya![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_caretaker_02",
      "hash64": "A86DE1BE5C0FEFFF",
      "text": "Hiya, indeed. I’m the caretaker here, and it’s\\na pleasure to welcome you to our town.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_caretaker_03",
      "hash64": "A86DE0BE5C0FEE4C",
      "text": "Kieran had mentioned you all would be coming.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_caretaker_04",
      "hash64": "A86DDFBE5C0FEC99",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)][VAR 0x0100(0000)]\\naside,\\r\\nthis\\r\\nis\\r\\neveryone’s\\r\\nfirst\\r\\ntime\\r\\nvisiting\\r\\nKitakami,\\r\\nis\\r\\nthat\\r\\nright?[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
