    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_friend_02",
      "hash64": "CA7C0710D7006017",
      "text": "Yeah, that’s the long and short of it.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_friend_03",
      "hash64": "CA7C0610D7005E64",
      "text": "What’re you saying?! It really is the first time for\\nthe rest of us![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_caretaker_05",
      "hash64": "A86DDEBE5C0FEAE6",
      "text": "I see, I see. Well, again, you’re most welcome.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_caretaker_06",
      "hash64": "A86DDDBE5C0FE933",
      "text": "You can sleep here at the community center.\\nAll the rooms have been freshened up for you.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_botan_03",
      "hash64": "8E4761E6A0AFCE0E",
      "text": "Whoa... Now that’s some thoughtful service.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_caretaker_07",
      "hash64": "A86DDCBE5C0FE780",
      "text": "Hahaha! It was no trouble. Now please, relax and\\nenjoy yourselves—but most of all, enjoy Kitakami![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_rival_04",
      "hash64": "6B6AAF96E5DDEDC5",
      "text": "Thanks very much, sir![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_friend_04",
      "hash64": "CA7C0510D7005CB1",
      "text": "So what about that Kieran guy? Have you heard\\nfrom him at all?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_botan_04",
      "hash64": "8E4764E6A0AFD327",
      "text": "EXCUSE me? He doesn’t have a smartphone?!\\nHow is this kid even alive?![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_rival_05",
      "hash64": "6B6AAE96E5DDEC12",
      "text": "He must not want any distractions from training!\\nThink he’s at his house? Should we go meet him?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_friend_npc",
      "hash64": "A4EB939C873C3800",
      "text": "I’m gonna make it clear once and for all who\\nyour REAL best friend is. Just you wait and see.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_botan_npc",
      "hash64": "152B81E1B3A5A5D2",
      "text": "Reception out here really is lousy. Me and my\\npoor phone don’t stand a chance...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_rival_npc",
      "hash64": "91F7116A64E2C80C",
      "text": "Do you think Kieran’s at his house? I can’t wait to\\nbat—uh, befriend him![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
